        "slc_e9e67b03aec161b157f60c7e468ace90dc9c77d6cb67c38445726dc24db35884"
      ],
      "text": "A session grants only the origin it was opened on; --allow adds named origins, loopback is reachable by default unless --no-loopback, and off-origin subresources are refused and logged."
    },
