        "slc_68b9d5cb23223ad40d355682652c58357849bc71d0f9d10b4389f31cebe569fe"
      ],
      "text": "Boxes are disposable environments holding code, agent, toolchain and optionally the browser session; box export produces a patch, report, receipt and timelines, and the agent has no direct host write path."
    },
